      "id": "upadesha-panchakam-1",
      "label": "Verse 1",
      "number": "1",
      "deva": "वेदो नित्यमधीयतां तदुदितं कर्म स्वनुष्ठीयतां\nतेनेशस्य विधीयतामपचितिः काम्ये मतिस्त्यज्यताम् ।\nपापौघः परिधूयतां भवसुखे दोषोऽनुसन्धीयताम्\nआत्मेच्छा व्यवसीयतां निजगृहात्तूर्णं विनिर्गम्यताम् ॥",
      "translation": "Study the Veda every day; properly perform the duties it teaches; through them offer worship to the Lord; give up desire for desired results; wash away the mass of wrongdoing; reflect on the fault in worldly pleasure; firmly resolve to seek the Self; promptly leave your own home.",
